  _id: L2
  _title: Chords
  _menuDescription: Learn three chords with your left hand. Each one has its own
    hand shape.
  _conceptExplanation: 
  _conceptSlides:
  - text: You've already played the notes of chords. Now you'll play whole chords
      with your left hand.
    seconds: 6
  - text: Each chord has its own hand shape. Make the shape, then strike down to
      play it.
    seconds: 6
  - text: 'The three chords tell a little story: getting ready, tension, then release.'
    seconds: 6
